{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-babysense-max-view-wireless-digital-video-baby-monitor-2604-0191","content_id":"d8373552-8995-454b-9ff3-4a2585c4b0ba","description":"Product Recall for Babysense Max View Wireless Digital Video Baby Monitor presenting a risk of fire. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"a46d9af3-1464-43bb-8de6-fa2317b2e028","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-08T14:29:24+01:00","id":"a46d9af3-1464-43bb-8de6-fa2317b2e028","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-05-08T14:29:24+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69fde5342a6137e93226b8df/2604-0191-product-recall-babysense-max-view-baby-monitor.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Babysense Max View Wireless Digital Video Baby Monitor</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The parent unit of this product presents a risk of fire as the battery within the unit (model reference YC6048115P) may overheat during charging.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Hisense.</p>\n\n<p>The listings have been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Childcare articles and children’s equipment - Baby Safety Monitoring (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Babysense</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>‘MaxView By Babysense’ 5.5” Split Screen Full HD 1080P Video Baby Monitor (VBM55RX)</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcodes</td>\n      <td>7290017603940, 7290017603926, 7290017603988</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASINs</td>\n      <td>B0C1C7LK5L, B0C1C8CWW2, B0C2D7PPNY</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A wireless digital video baby monitor, comprising of a video monitor display unit/screen (the ‘parent’ unit); a camera (the ‘baby’ unit) and AC power adapters used to charge the parent and baby unit. When both units are switched on, the display screen on the parent unit will show the video/image captured by the baby unit. Only serial numbers beginning with ‘MVRX’ are affected. The serial number can be located on the back of the parent unit (i.e. the video monitor display unit/screen) – see Annex A in the linked PDF. Other models and ASINs are out of this recall scope.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_a46d9af3-1464-43bb-8de6-fa2317b2e028\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69fde5342a6137e93226b8df/2604-0191-product-recall-babysense-max-view-baby-monitor.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The parent unit of this product presents a risk of fire as the battery within the unit (model reference YC6048115P) may overheat during charging. Such overheating may escalate into thermal runaway.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Hisense.</p>\n\n<p>We recommend that consumers stop using the product immediately. To determine if your product is affected and to register for a replacement Parent Unit, please access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://support.recallsecure.com/en-gb\">https://support.recallsecure.com/en-gb</a></p>\n\n<p>The listings have been removed by the online marketplaces (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2604-0191</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-08T13:40:18Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"childcare-articles-childrens-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-08","product_risk_level":"medium"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-05-08T14:40:19+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-babysense-max-view-wireless-digital-video-baby-monitor-2604-0191","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-babysense-max-view-wireless-digital-video-baby-monitor-2604-0191","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-babysense-max-view-wireless-digital-video-baby-monitor-2604-0191","content_id":"d8373552-8995-454b-9ff3-4a2585c4b0ba","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-05-08T13:40:19Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Babysense Max View Wireless Digital Video Baby Monitor (2604-0191)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-babysense-max-view-wireless-digital-video-baby-monitor-2604-0191","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safe